--------------------
1. Definitions
"Documentation" means schematic diagrams, designs, circuit or physical
layouts, models, specification sheets, source code, object code and
other design documentation relating to the hardware described in this
repository.

"Product" means any tangible device or component prepared according to
the Documentation.

